Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue 1: Pods not getting Istio sidecar injection

# Check if namespace has sidecar injection enabled
oc get namespace canary-demo -o yaml | grep istio-injection

# If not enabled, add the annotation
oc label namespace canary-demo istio-injection=enabled
Issue 2: Gateway URL not accessible

# Check if ingress gateway is running
oc get pods -n istio-system | grep ingressgateway

# Check gateway configuration
oc describe gateway webapp-gateway -n canary-demo

# Verify route exists
oc get routes -n istio-system
Issue 3: Traffic not splitting as expected

# Verify DestinationRule subsets
oc describe destinationrule webapp-dr -n canary-demo

# Check VirtualService configuration
oc describe virtualservice webapp-vs -n canary-demo

# Verify pod labels match subset selectors
oc get pods -n canary-demo --show-labels
Issue 4: Monitoring script not working

# Check if curl is available
which curl

# Test direct pod access
oc port-forward svc/webapp-service 8080:80 -n canary-demo
# Then test: curl localhost:8080
