Key Achievements
Deployed Multiple Application Versions: You successfully deployed stable (v1), canary (v2), and problematic (v3) versions of a web application with proper Istio sidecar injection.

Implemented Progressive Traffic Routing: You learned how to use Istio VirtualService and DestinationRule to gradually shift traffic from 100% stable to various percentages of canary traffic (10%, 50%, and 5% for problematic version).

